+No Upstate Liberty map/data/menu files. The GTA III HD Vehicles Tri-Pack, III.Upstate.asi and GTA3-specific external binary fixes were not installed in VC. Widescreen/window sizing and Modloader are implemented in the native engine. VC-compatible replacement assets/scripts are needed for additional III-only packs. This is not a promise of 60 FPS in every scene.
